{"bangumi":{"date":"2020-07-12","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/dd/0d/294654_ca6tM.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/dd/0d/294654_ca6tM.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/dd/0d/294654_ca6tM.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/dd/0d/294654_ca6tM.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/dd/0d/294654_ca6tM.jpg"},"summary":"这里是魔族和人类共同生活的街道“林德沃尔姆”。新人医生·格伦医生，今天也在城镇里繁忙地诊察中—— 给美人鱼的鳃做深度检查、对血肉魔像的大腿进行缝合手术、帮助哈耳庇厄进行产卵，以及对龙的每一块鳞片进行触诊。 为了拯救外表、构造、性质都完全不同的她们，格伦明明只是尽全力给她们检查而已，却不知为何充满了很危险的♥气氛……但是没关系，因为这些都是100%的医疗行为而已！ 虽然也有被拉弥亚族的助手莎妃的尾巴勒住导致差点窒息的时候，但是今天的诊疗所也会照常营业！ 史上首次深入魔物娘生态的医疗幻想冒险谭，开幕！","name":"モンスター娘のお医者さん","name_cn":"魔物娘的医生","tags":[{"name":"2020年7月","count":362,"total_count":12739},{"name":"魔物娘","count":350,"total_count":478},{"name":"轻小说改","count":315,"total_count":497031},{"name":"后宫","count":304,"total_count":303942},{"name":"肉番","count":290,"total_count":32964},{"name":"日常","count":236,"total_count":401455},{"name":"TV","count":217,"total_count":1406935},{"name":"搞笑","count":165,"total_count":640153},{"name":"ARVOANIMATION","count":133,"total_count":1048},{"name":"2020","count":113,"total_count":64044},{"name":"轻改","count":86,"total_count":152676},{"name":"人外","count":85,"total_count":1528},{"name":"卖肉","count":75,"total_count":69452},{"name":"奇幻","count":53,"total_count":472923},{"name":"小说改","count":40,"total_count":160132},{"name":"巨乳","count":39,"total_count":32874},{"name":"异世界","count":21,"total_count":263005},{"name":"日本","count":20,"total_count":298515},{"name":"岩崎良明","count":12,"total_count":669},{"name":"肉","count":11,"total_count":29536},{"name":"魔物娘的医生","count":8,"total_count":9},{"name":"2020年","count":5,"total_count":3045},{"name":"日本动画","count":5,"total_count":34923},{"name":"土岐隼一","count":4,"total_count":56},{"name":"アルボアニメーション","count":4,"total_count":40},{"name":"恋爱","count":4,"total_count":565741},{"name":"2020夏","count":4,"total_count":122},{"name":"大西沙織","count